{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:755f1d5ed21884dd603e672c079c3ab14300986229b0f7944f90d66bef52d484",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8ae8d13ff682764aff9e0acf57e743ad8f6b6f43bdf46197cebb572a8d12739",
      "text": "欢迎光临！\n哦，是武和涟啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a9b4209473fefb912a7601331baaed9d3fafddafebd968c62de3cef1e2829fe",
      "text": "今天你们两个，都有好好把门打开\n再走进来呢。真乖！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f66549388a068f77d73785aa38b6898a8436003f6b879f1f1d3726202856def5",
      "text": "求你别再提那件事了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e962ca184642b090088b4a81f54f66fdb8d69c1045602bbcf26e0b65c12274",
      "text": "哼。那时候要不是拉面店的出来拦着，\n绝对是本大爷赢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ef90613b9f4f3d962eeabd6beb7a2f99a6584754884afc1aa1f4a91314399b7",
      "text": "那都是很久以前的事了吧。话说你给人家\n添了那么多麻烦，居然还用这种口气……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbd219f97574c285d310110fea8c8f21956f0a5fae49ee50de6cfacc9f8bf8d",
      "text": "好了好了。\n不说那个了，照旧就行吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:783bc5c6fdfd36e73e3001e194b9788588fa7e085b18e4b056e40cb9f29066a4",
      "text": "啧……要特大份的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74c33aec5cb2eeaf8996e495423ab22d703f11624852531ffc2056cca6d3eea",
      "text": "（……那天找小不点打架，\n踢烂这家店的门之前的事我都记得）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec87d0e5f30b45b5e9291511a1f8536be977c489cd5851a1749f57ad97a346b4",
      "text": "（但之后的事就没记忆了。\n等回过神来，人已经在拉面店的家里了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17d0b59ffa763879eb1a854aec86babca55cd190627e3602e6e86a724e984a87",
      "text": "（没能分出胜负固然很火大，\n最糟糕的是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eee810edd31a355ee5b85234baa184638870785263d5ce80368a9de91cdd65c",
      "text": "好咧！特大份两碗，久等！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f08fa14eaf7dc0b48fcf8b33a517bef4bea4734799daccc814f514cef88a53",
      "text": "（打从那天起，只要想跟小不点打架\n脑袋就会痛，根本顾不上动手！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2576e3f000d0753bfd4bd9964b67302f2416ae2c68630f526d55b4a6388df6b",
      "text": "（可恶……本大爷到底怎么了？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
